{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"苏格拉底·life-and-times","stage":"DONE","category":"socrates","categoryLabel":"苏格拉底","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.97,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/20_socrates/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<p>苏格拉底（约公元前470年—前399年）没有留下一字著作，他的形象由他人之笔塑成。本部分&quot;生平与时代&quot;追溯其生命历程的<strong>事实骨架</strong>——出身、从军、街头哲学、家庭品格，直至受审与赴死——并把这条个人轨迹放回雅典由盛而衰的大时代背景中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的定位-讲-事实与生平-不讲-思想内容\">本 hub 的定位：讲&quot;事实与生平&quot;，不讲&quot;思想内容&quot;</h2><p>苏格拉底主题共有六个姊妹 hub，分工明确，本 hub 是其余各 hub 的<strong>历史与传记入口</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>1 生平与时代（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>他是谁?何时何地经历了什么?</td>\n<td>提供史实骨架与时代背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他对哲学的根本贡献是什么?</td>\n<td>本 hub 的&quot;哲学转向&quot;在此展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>自知无知、产婆术、省察人生具体是什么?</td>\n<td>本 hub 提及的概念在此深究</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 主要著作</a></td>\n<td>他不写作,我们如何得知其思想?</td>\n<td>解释本 hub 史料的可靠性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>他如何塑造了后世哲学?</td>\n<td>本 hub&quot;赴死&quot;之后的故事</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>哪些是史实、哪些是建构?</td>\n<td>校准本 hub 的&quot;事实&quot;边界</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>边界约定</strong>：本 hub 只在&quot;他经历了什么&quot;的层面叙事；凡涉及&quot;产婆术怎么运作&quot;&quot;自知无知是什么意思&quot;等思想内容，一律以相对链接指向 hub 3，不在此重复展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐阅读路径\">推荐阅读路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[1 雅典之子&lt;br/&gt;时代与出身] --&gt; B[2 从士兵到哲人&lt;br/&gt;哲学转向]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3 广场与对话&lt;br/&gt;哲学现场]&#10;    C --&gt; D[4 家庭与品格&lt;br/&gt;凡人肖像]&#10;    D --&gt; E[5 审判&lt;br/&gt;政治清算]&#10;    E --&gt; F[6 从容赴死&lt;br/&gt;殉道与意义]\">flowchart LR\n    A[1 雅典之子&lt;br/&gt;时代与出身] --&gt; B[2 从士兵到哲人&lt;br/&gt;哲学转向]\n    B --&gt; C[3 广场与对话&lt;br/&gt;哲学现场]\n    C --&gt; D[4 家庭与品格&lt;br/&gt;凡人肖像]\n    D --&gt; E[5 审判&lt;br/&gt;政治清算]\n    E --&gt; F[6 从容赴死&lt;br/&gt;殉道与意义]</pre><p>按章节顺序通读即可：先建立时代坐标（1-2），再理解他作为街头哲人的日常与性格（3-4），最后走向审判与死亡的高潮（5-6）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置与延伸\">前置与延伸</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置知识</strong>：无需哲学基础；若对雅典直接民主、伯罗奔尼撒战争、提洛同盟等背景陌生，<a href=\"athens-and-youth/a-son-of-athens\">雅典之子</a> 已内置必要的时代说明。</li>\n<li><strong>关键提醒</strong>：苏格拉底不写作，本 hub 的全部&quot;事实&quot;都经柏拉图、色诺芬、阿里斯托芬之笔转述，彼此并不一致。阅读时请带着 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/the-socratic-problem\">苏格拉底问题</a> 的意识——区分&quot;较可靠的史实&quot;与&quot;后世的传说渲染&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>自然延伸</strong>：读完本 hub 想深入其思想，转 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>；想了解其身后影响，转 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"athens-and-youth","title":"Athens And Youth","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/athens-and-youth","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-son-of-athens","title":"雅典之子","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/athens-and-youth/a-son-of-athens"},{"seq":2,"slug":"from-soldier-to-philosopher","title":"从士兵到哲人","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/athens-and-youth/from-soldier-to-philosopher"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-street-philosopher","title":"The Street Philosopher","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/the-street-philosopher","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-agora-and-dialogue","title":"广场与对话","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/the-street-philosopher/the-agora-and-dialogue"},{"seq":2,"slug":"family-and-character","title":"家庭与品格","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/the-street-philosopher/family-and-character"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"trial-and-death","title":"Trial And Death","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/trial-and-death","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-trial","title":"审判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/trial-and-death/the-trial"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-death","title":"从容赴死","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/trial-and-death/the-death"}]}]}